# Copy apps/api/.env.example to apps/api/.env and set a private JWT_SECRET.
# Copy apps/web/.env.example to apps/web/.env.local.
# This root file is documentation; workspace commands read their app's env file.
# For integration tests against your own disposable DB (database name MUST contain test):
# TEST_MONGODB_URI=mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/nexora_test
# Otherwise tests use a checksum-verified, ephemeral real mongod binary.
